# M4.23 local repository context

- Date: 2026-08-28
- Scope: local, read-only source inspection
- Error: a Control-SSOT configuration path was queried while the command working directory was the application repository.
- Cause: a relative path crossed the two deliberately separate repositories.
- Impact: none. The application migration reads completed; no file or server state was changed.
- Recovery: use the absolute Control-SSOT path for cross-repository reads.
- Rollback: not applicable; the failed operation was read-only.
